cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Mario Fly Brain: Biologically Constrained Drosophila Connectome Reinforcement Learning in Super Mario 64"
message: "If you use this software, connectome pipeline, or environment harness in your research, academic work, or public media, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
