    affiliation: Elizabethtown College
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nietch2/Superfly64"
url: "https://github.com/Nietch2/SuperFly64"
abstract: >-
  An Embodied AI framework mapping the Drosophila melanogaster Mushroom Body
  connectome (FlyWire/FAFB dataset) to control Mario in Super Mario 64 via
  libsm64, utilizing biologically constrained dopaminergic reward pathways
  (KC, MBON, PAM, and PPL neuron clusters) for autonomous 3D foraging.
keywords:
  - connectome
  - drosophila
  - mushroom-body
  - reinforcement-learning
  - computational-neuroscience
  - sm64
  - libsm64
  - embodied-ai
